  ('a8799a0f-16b7-598e-885d-f51dbe428545'::uuid,1,'Have you ever accepted a last-minute invitation from someone you liked, then wondered what you''d just agreed to?','have you ever accepted a last minute invitation from someone you liked then wondered what you''d just agreed to','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
