  ('7a894216-7ce2-5ecd-8a4d-5d8ff76f2720'::uuid,1,'Have you ever challenged someone to make the first move—and then been surprised when they did?','have you ever challenged someone to make the first move and then been surprised when they did','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
