  ('73ed1b17-cd28-554a-a221-4af70edbcb88'::uuid,1,'When I enter a party where I barely know anyone, where do I start? — Find the food table / Look for one familiar face / Join the loudest conversation / Find a quiet corner and settle in','when i enter a party where i barely know anyone where do i start find the food table look for one familiar face join the loudest conversation find a quiet corner and settle in','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('071b9145-f8a8-50d8-9f92-0d0c46f2266b'::uuid,1,'What is most likely to make me feel instantly at home? — Familiar food / People speaking warmly / A comfortable quiet corner / Music I already love','what is most likely to make me feel instantly at home familiar food people speaking warmly a comfortable quiet corner music i already love','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('4c66a808-1fbc-572e-973c-2d0377ce3e4b'::uuid,1,'Which contradiction describes me best? — Independent but wanting reassurance / Private but enjoying attention / Calm until suddenly overwhelmed / Flexible about everything except my principles','which contradiction describes me best independent but wanting reassurance private but enjoying attention calm until suddenly overwhelmed flexible about everything except my principles','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('130bff20-d3f9-50fe-be33-8bcb86f497c5'::uuid,1,'Which personal win would change how I carry myself? — Becoming financially secure / Mastering a feared skill / Leaving an unhealthy pattern / Being recognised by people I respect','which personal win would change how i carry myself becoming financially secure mastering a feared skill leaving an unhealthy pattern being recognised by people i respect','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('14da5232-bcee-5d45-b134-185cd2bfa243'::uuid,1,'If I walked into a party where I knew nobody, what would I do? — Find one friendly face / Introduce myself around / Stay near the food / Consider leaving early','if i walked into a party where i knew nobody what would i do find one friendly face introduce myself around stay near the food consider leaving early','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('19bf3cc5-c6bc-52e7-9df2-699c1f2d79ad'::uuid,1,'When I care about someone, how do I show it without saying it? — I check on them often / I solve practical problems / I remember small details / I make time no matter what','when i care about someone how do i show it without saying it i check on them often i solve practical problems i remember small details i make time no matter what','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('1a195c1d-6eb1-5338-b6d8-1e12eb8502e1'::uuid,1,'When I miss someone, what am I most likely to do? — Send them something funny / Call without planning it / Look through old memories / Wait for them to reach out','when i miss someone what am i most likely to do send them something funny call without planning it look through old memories wait for them to reach out','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('cc40b2d4-f9e9-507d-8394-e1a3ef0bc1e2'::uuid,1,'When I receive an unexpected compliment, what''s my automatic reaction? — Say thank you confidently / Laugh and change the subject / Return the compliment immediately / Ask what made them say that','when i receive an unexpected compliment what''s my automatic reaction say thank you confidently laugh and change the subject return the compliment immediately ask what made them say that','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('38ff3c36-49ec-5e23-bb91-1e894fc358fb'::uuid,1,'After an awkward social moment, what do I tend to do? — Replay it in my head later / Turn it into a joke / Pretend it never happened / Tell a close friend everything','after an awkward social moment what do i tend to do replay it in my head later turn it into a joke pretend it never happened tell a close friend everything','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('20ac215b-cd81-5d45-9d69-95bade94e741'::uuid,1,'Which compliment would stay with me the longest? — You make people feel safe / You always find a way / You are unforgettable / You bring out the best in me','which compliment would stay with me the longest you make people feel safe you always find a way you are unforgettable you bring out the best in me','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('cbe8f73c-b732-5c68-a40c-b71fcd98c460'::uuid,1,'When I say ''I''m fine'' after a rough day, what do I usually mean? — I need quiet before I talk / I want someone to ask again / I really am moving on / I''m upset but don''t have words yet','when i say ''i''m fine'' after a rough day what do i usually mean i need quiet before i talk i want someone to ask again i really am moving on i''m upset but don''t have words yet','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('2de19339-a61c-54d3-b14d-859c62f95f85'::uuid,1,'Which type of misunderstanding can become funny later? — A misheard sentence / Going to the wrong location / Mistaking someone for another person / Taking a harmless joke seriously','which type of misunderstanding can become funny later a misheard sentence going to the wrong location mistaking someone for another person taking a harmless joke seriously','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('ac93d558-0bc5-5bbc-8766-55f0b1061c39'::uuid,1,'Which personal habit would surprise someone who only knows me casually? — I rehearse conversations / I keep sentimental objects / I need more alone time than expected / I notice tiny changes in people','which personal habit would surprise someone who only knows me casually i rehearse conversations i keep sentimental objects i need more alone time than expected i notice tiny changes in people','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
