  ('7c7b661b-db7d-534e-9a86-d05604fc0faf'::uuid,1,'Your office stapler forms a one-item union and refuses to work until someone gives it a proper job title.','your office stapler forms a one item union and refuses to work until someone gives it a proper job title','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('c244258b-b686-5c94-ab1e-99380e5bd273'::uuid,1,'Your landlord adds a “ghost maintenance fee” to the rent and provides a blurry photo as evidence.','your landlord adds a ghost maintenance fee to the rent and provides a blurry photo as evidence','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('e5a4e285-06c5-54e4-846b-1aa4829d6a0f'::uuid,1,'Your childhood superhero alias starts receiving fan mail addressed to your garden shed. The town council has planned a ceremony to unveil the shed as your ''secret headquarters'' tonight.','your childhood superhero alias starts receiving fan mail addressed to your garden shed the town council has planned a ceremony to unveil the shed as your ''secret headquarters'' tonight','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('cde5e193-9242-5a33-bfdc-4f63884bfd9d'::uuid,1,'You are mistakenly added to a highly organised neighbourhood committee, and your first assigned task is “manage the geese.”','you are mistakenly added to a highly organised neighbourhood committee and your first assigned task is manage the geese','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('ce2c821a-3443-52c6-b7c2-0a619cc8d5ba'::uuid,1,'A stranger challenges you to a dance battle in a supermarket aisle and nearby shoppers quietly make space.','a stranger challenges you to a dance battle in a supermarket aisle and nearby shoppers quietly make space','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('e2dd7f8b-af1e-5467-a8d7-81fde175eb66'::uuid,1,'You collect the wrong suitcase at the airport. Every item inside has your name on it, but none of it belongs to you. Airline staff want proof.','you collect the wrong suitcase at the airport every item inside has your name on it but none of it belongs to you airline staff want proof','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('53197e7e-7167-596d-b8e7-07cc474a2ded'::uuid,1,'Your mirror reflection starts practising job-interview answers before you speak—and somehow answers better than you do.','your mirror reflection starts practising job interview answers before you speak and somehow answers better than you do','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('ea27a838-cb9d-599c-b40c-7fac49e94303'::uuid,1,'An inflatable flamingo appears in every photo from your holiday. At baggage claim, it turns up wearing your luggage tag, and airport staff insist you declare it as an extra passenger.','an inflatable flamingo appears in every photo from your holiday at baggage claim it turns up wearing your luggage tag and airport staff insist you declare it as an extra passenger','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('e784de3b-5174-5b46-820c-dd871cdf1c58'::uuid,1,'A goat follows you home from the market and refuses to leave your doorway. Nobody nearby admits owning it.','a goat follows you home from the market and refuses to leave your doorway nobody nearby admits owning it','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('5821b68b-39ac-51da-b26f-929e1578cbc2'::uuid,1,'Your family''s portraits have started rearranging themselves each night according to who behaved best at dinner. You''re now at the very back of the family photo, and relatives are visiting tomorrow.','your family''s portraits have started rearranging themselves each night according to who behaved best at dinner you''re now at the very back of the family photo and relatives are visiting tomorrow','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('fff9b09f-df6e-52e2-982d-bb198a59c76d'::uuid,1,'Your future self sends an apology card for ruining tomorrow’s surprise party and asks you not to cancel it.','your future self sends an apology card for ruining tomorrow''s surprise party and asks you not to cancel it','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('c0bc92f1-05e6-5438-92f2-fa51bcf466a1'::uuid,1,'Your shoes have started a band without you and booked their first concert for tonight. They expect you to explain to the audience why their drummer—a missing sock—hasn''t arrived.','your shoes have started a band without you and booked their first concert for tonight they expect you to explain to the audience why their drummer a missing sock hasn''t arrived','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('f423c813-d3f1-5f34-a715-9d525acb2718'::uuid,1,'A photo booth prints a picture of you winning tomorrow''s gardening competition. You don''t own a single plant, but the organisers have entered you as a finalist and sent you an enormous trophy display case.','a photo booth prints a picture of you winning tomorrow''s gardening competition you don''t own a single plant but the organisers have entered you as a finalist and sent you an enormous trophy display case','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('ff1b8d22-fa93-5e3d-8e38-4a6018dca17b'::uuid,1,'Your office chair squeaks only when you say something untrue, and your coworkers have noticed the pattern.','your office chair squeaks only when you say something untrue and your coworkers have noticed the pattern','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import'),
  ('39736257-1508-52a2-9307-29e2eb5e4e9d'::uuid,1,'Your sofa declares itself a holiday rental and accepts a booking from a family of cushions for tonight. Twelve actual human guests are coming, and the sofa refuses to cancel the reservation.','your sofa declares itself a holiday rental and accepts a booking from a family of cushions for tonight twelve actual human guests are coming and the sofa refuses to cancel the reservation','{}'::jsonb,'published','Initial deterministic bundled-content import')
